From 58b57285747b2e76c6291c039b5d2d4f46112c55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:54:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: visionox-vtdr6130: fix RP6 init sequence and
 backlight ops

Port the Retroid Pocket 6 / Pocket Dual Screen panel fixes from
RetroidPocket/linux (fe2f4436dfcf, 58b57285747b):
- Fix missing 0xF0 command byte before page 0x10 select (0xF0, 0xAA, 0x10)
  and add the missing page-0x10 0xD0 timing configuration sequence.
- Use mipi_dsi_dcs_write_seq_multi() instead of generic writes.
- Increase post-exit_sleep_mode delay to 150 ms and post-set_display_on
  delay to 50 ms.
- Guard against NULL connector in vtdr6130_get_current_mode().
- Assert reset GPIO on init_sequence failure in vtdr6130_prepare().
- Fix physical dimensions (68x120 mm portrait instead of swapped 120x68).
- Always restore MIPI_DSI_MODE_LPM in backlight update/get ops even when
  the DCS transfer returns an error.
- Add "retroidpocket,rp6-panel" and "retroidpocket,rpduo-panel-top"
  compatibles alongside existing "vtdr6130,rp6".

Signed-off-by: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
